WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.649
So everything is just falling apart for Donald
Trump.

00:00:03.649 --> 00:00:07.490
Not only that, his niece write a horrifying
book about him.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:13.690
Not only did his sister get caught on leaked
audio slamming him, but now there are reports

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:21.100
that Donald Trump's own wife, Melania Trump,
the first lady, has been caught on tape making

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:26.760
disparaging comments about both Donald Trump
himself and his children.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:32.160
The recording has been reportedly made by
Stephanie Winston Wolkoff, who's a former

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:36.750
adviser to Melania, and she's going to be
putting out a book in September called Melania

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:37.850
and Me.

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:41.030
The Rise and Fall of My Friendship with the
First Lady.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:48.120
Now, this is essentially gossip in a sense,
but it's gossip that goes to the same story.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:50.370
Trump doesn't have normal relationships.

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:52.120
He's not a normal person.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:57.290
Many of the people around him are around him,
not just because they enjoy it, but for who

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.800
knows what kinds of other reasons.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:06.920
And much like he ruins personal relationships,
he ruins our relationship as a country with

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:07.920
our allies.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:09.720
He's just ruining everything that he touches.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:12.079
Now, the book will eventually have the details.

00:01:12.079 --> 00:01:13.829
It'll be released in September.

00:01:13.829 --> 00:01:15.740
Presumably audio will also be released.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:20.369
But reportedly, Melania Trump in these recordings
attacks Ivana Trump.

00:01:20.369 --> 00:01:26.189
I guess Melania really doesn't like Vanka
and attacks Donald Trump himself and attacks

00:01:26.189 --> 00:01:27.969
Trump's other adult children.

00:01:27.969 --> 00:01:30.520
So this is really just a reality show.

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:34.880
And and again, as I said just a few minutes
ago in the last story, I look forward to and

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:40.939
would welcome gladly a boring Biden presidency
and things just being boring for a while while

00:01:40.939 --> 00:01:42.299
Donald Trump is gone.

00:01:42.299 --> 00:01:47.919
Now, this is the same adviser to Melania,
by the way, writing this book that told Melania.

00:01:47.919 --> 00:01:51.169
Remember when they came up with that B best
thing?

00:01:51.169 --> 00:01:54.509
And it sounded just like a grammatical mistake.

00:01:54.509 --> 00:01:59.170
This same adviser to Melania, who reportedly
recorded Melania disparaging Trump and his

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:05.289
children, told Melania that her B best slogan
sounded alliterate, which it does.

00:02:05.289 --> 00:02:10.540
I mean, it sounds illiterate and it also sounds
potentially place plagiarized, which I'm actually

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:17.810
less sure about, if nothing else, removing
this and putting the Biden family in the White

00:02:17.810 --> 00:02:18.810
House.

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:22.460
It would just be a breath of fresh air to
just make this garbage stop.

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:24.740
Boring presidency I welcome.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.590
And I can tell you boring won't be particularly
good for my business, but who cares?

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:30.150
It'll be good for the country.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:35.060
A scandal a day, you know, white knuckling
it with some new scandal every single week.

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:36.060
It really is exhausting.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.490
Now, to be clear.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:42.640
Biden being boring doesn't mean we stop paying
attention if Biden wins.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.070
It doesn't mean we stop lobbying for progressive
change.

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:49.890
It just means the process gets back to one
of being mildly connected to how modern Western

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.520
