00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:56.000
Now, of course, if Biden is president, Fox
News will find scandals.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.650
They will fabricate scandals.

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.830
They will concoct scandals if they need to.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:04.320
