00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:25.910
Joe Biden will still be dealing with a pandemic.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:26.910
Nothing is fixed.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:31.910
If Biden becomes president, it gives us the
